@host = http://localhost:5133

### Healthcheck
GET {{host}}/v1/healthcheck

### Metrics (expvar equivalent)
GET {{host}}/debug/vars

### Get movies
GET {{host}}/v1/movies?title=godfather&genres=crime,drama&page=1&page_size=5&sort=year

### Create movie
POST {{host}}/v1/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Moana","year":2016,"runtime":"107 mins","genres":["animation","adventure"]}

### Create movie - invalid request
POST {{host}}/v1/movies
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"","year": 2016,"runtime":"107 mins","genres":["animation","adventure"]}

### Get movie
GET {{host}}/v1/movies/1

### Update movie
PATCH {{host}}/v1/movies/1
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Movie1","year": 2000,"runtime":"107 mins","genres":["animation","adventure"]}

### Update movie partially
PATCH {{host}}/v1/movies/1
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Movie2","year": 2005}

### Delete movie
DELETE {{host}}/v1/movies/1

### Create user (activation token is printed in the API log)
POST {{host}}/v1/users
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Nikola","email":"nikola@example.com","password":"nikola.12345"}

### Activate user (paste the token from the log)
PUT {{host}}/v1/users/activated
Content-Type: application/json

{ "token": "EOD2U6RNIZ6PNRAO6PIAQHN74W" }
